# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates. .gitignore syntax;
# only files that match AND are gitignored are copied, so nothing tracked is duplicated.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so without this .env.local is absent, src/test/setup-db.ts
# finds no DATABASE_URL, and the entire `db` vitest project skips — a green suite over an
# untested half of the repo. It is the only gitignored file the suite reads.
#
# `.env.migrate` — the admin URL `pnpm db:migrate` reads — is deliberately not here. It exists
# in the primary checkout only, so a run in a worktree has no admin credential on any path it
# reads. docs/guidelines.md §5, the capability boundary.
#
# Note: processed by worktrees Claude Code creates (--worktree, subagent worktrees, desktop
# parallel sessions, scheduled tasks with the worktree toggle). A hand-run `git worktree add`
# copies nothing.

.env.local
